  "definition": "Stormwater Treatment Practices: Infiltration Practices",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-08-06",
  "expirationDate": "2036-08-06",
  "historyNote": "#9343, eff 1-1-09; amd by #9817-A, eff 12-1-10; ss by #12342 (formerly Env-Wq 1508.05); ss by #13758, eff 9-28-23 (formerly Env-Wq 1508.06); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; ss by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
